<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - H.F. Ahmanson restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - H.F. Ahmanson restarted.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Boston said it reinstated coverage of H.F. Ahmanson and Co as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On Wednesday, H.F. Ahmanson abandoned its hostile bid to acquire Great Western Financial Corp, clearing the way for Great Western to merge with Washington Mutual Inc.</p>
<p>-- Ahmanson gained 3/4 to 42-1/4.</p>
</text>
